    "en": "1. Enter a topic or brief (any language) on the left.\n2. Click Generate Chinese Draft for a zh-first article.\n3. Review and edit the draft on the right.\n4. Select text and press Ctrl+K (Mac: ⌘K) for inline AI edits.\n5. Click Confirm & Publish to translate all locales and publish to the public blog.",
